<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52901" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλχη</span></b> , ἡ, (perh. a
		loan-word) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>murex, purple
			limpet</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορφύρα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				393
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>purple dye</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				11.14.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>rosette</i> on the capitals of columns, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.372.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.1484.83
			</span></i> (Epid., <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				11(2).161
			</span></i><i><span class="en">
				<u>A</u>
				73
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>:—written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χάλκη</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.374.317
			</span></i>, al., <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χάλχη</span></b>  ib.<i><span class="en">
				374.103
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>purple flower, Chrysanthemum coronarium</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.Dam.
				76J.
			</span></i>:—written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χάλκη</span></b>  in <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				74.60
			</span></i>, cf. Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.58
			</span></i>.</div>
